"Only press this after checking Fio internet banking and finding no batch. It"
" allows Odoo to send these payments again."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte až potom, čo v internet bankingu Fio žiadnu dávku nenájdete. Umožní "
"to Odoo odoslať tieto platby znova."

#. module: account_payment_fio
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_payment_fio.account_payment_order_view_form_fio
