"Only press this after finding the batch in Fio internet banking. It stops "
"Odoo from sending these payments again."
msgstr ""
"Stlačte až potom, čo dávku nájdete v internet bankingu Fio. Zabráni to Odoo "
"odoslať tieto platby znova."

